title: Proxmox Backup Server
agents: linux
catalog: os/linux
author: Marcel Pennewiss <opensource@pennewiss.de>
license: GPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check receives data from the agent plugin proxmox_backup_server.
 You can monitor the site, utilization and garbage collector status of all mounted or unremovable datastores.

inventory:
 One service is created on each datastore. The levels can be configured.
